---
import { SITE } from '../consts'
---

<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Top Grid: Brand & Navigation Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-5">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-teal-600 text-white font-bold text-sm">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{SITE.title}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-sm">
          {SITE.subtitle}。致力于提供客观、安全的技术指引与网络排查方案，助力顺畅视听体验。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-200 dark:bg-rose-950/40 dark:text-rose-300 dark:border-rose-900">
            18+ 成人限制
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200 dark:bg-teal-950/40 dark:text-teal-300 dark:border-teal-900">
            非官方独立指南
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: 入口与教程 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">入口与教程</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/guide/official-site/latest-address-2026/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">官网入口导航</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide/download/ios-installation-steps/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">iOS 安装全攻略</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide/download/android-apk-troubleshooting/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">安卓安装与排错</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide/how-to-use/complete-beginners-guide/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">新手入门教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guide/faq/billing-and-ad-policy/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">常见问题FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: 访问问题解决 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">访问问题解决</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/problems/cant-open/dns-resolution-failure/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">打不开怎么办</a></li>
          <li><a href="/problems/region-lock/geoblocking-explained/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">地区限制解决方案</a></li>
          <li><a href="/problems/buffering/video-loading-stuck/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">一直转圈缓冲排查</a></li>
          <li><a href="/problems/app-crash/ios-signature-revoked/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">App闪退急救</a></li>
          <li><a href="/problems/no-access/http-error-codes-guide/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">1020/403报错修复</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: 光速云与合规 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 dark:text-white">推荐与合规</h3>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/gsy/pricing/plan-comparison-guide/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">光速云套餐价格</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gsy/huangguo/why-choose-gsy-for-short-drama/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">短剧场景专属适配</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gsy/tutorial/desktop-setup-guide/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">客户端配置教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about/disclosure/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">推广与免责声明</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about/privacy/" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:text-gray-400">隐私权政策</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mandatory Legal Disclaimer & Disclosure Box -->
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-100 p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400">
        <p class="font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
          ⚠️ 法律与免责声明：
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1">
          {SITE.footer.disclaimer}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500">
          * 推广披露：本站部分页面包含商业推广推荐链接（显式标注“含推广链接”）。若您通过本站推荐链接购买光速云服务，本站可能会获得一定佣金，但这不会增加您的实际支付费用。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Copyright & Domain Mention -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500">
        <p>{SITE.footer.copyright}</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:underline">站点地图 (Sitemap)</a>
          <a href="/about/terms/" class="hover:underline">服务条款</a>
          <a href="/about/privacy/" class="hover:underline">隐私政策</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
